  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner support in developing and strengthening fundraising and resource mobilization strategies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support CAFOD partners to develop their organizational sustainability through improved resource mobilization potential by developing and strengthening fundraising strategies. Major workshops will be held with key focus areas that will include organizational and fundraising strategies, donor and resource mapping, financial planning and sustainability, understanding donors and donor trends amongs others.  The participants will include senior programme and finance staff in the partner organization. Priority will be given to parners being phased out then followed by those that CAFOD has committed a longer term engagement.</narrative>
  </description>
